name: Freeze bounded source evidence, read every supplied file and recover without spending
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
require-env: KUZUSHI_REVIEW_TEST_BIN
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE KUZUSHI_AGENT_MCPS NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_source_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: plan review
require-live-snap: 25 Triage findings | review-picker
keys: Space Enter
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN FINDING REVIEW | review-plan
keys: e
require-live-snap: 25 Use s to choose standard | source-policy-blocker
expect: No plan or spending changed
keys: s s
require-live-snap: 25 Review strategy: standard | standard-strategy
keys: c e
require-live-snap: 25 Cited source: selected | selected-source
expect: 32768 bytes maximum
ask: Can the operator select cited source deliberately without silently changing strategy, granting calls or starting work?
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 35 Cited source: 1/1 primary files | frozen-source
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_source_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME prepared
keys: v Home
require-live-snap: 25 FROZEN SOURCE INPUT | source-reader
expect: SOURCE_LINE_00
resize: 160x48
keys: Home
live-snap: source-160x48
resize: 96x89
keys: Home
live-snap: source-96x89
resize: 80x24
keys: Home
live-snap: source-80x24
resize: 60x20
keys: Home
live-snap: source-60x20
resize: 40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 FROZEN SOURCE INPUT | source-40x12
keys: NPage NPage
live-snap: code-40x12
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 Dollar charges are uncertain | source-tail-40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 20 FROZEN SOURCE INPUT | source-home-40x12
ask: Is the frozen code readable at every size, with primary-file scope, no invented dependency coverage, and source identity kept separate from finding correctness?
resize: 120x36
keys: v
require-live-snap: 20 Cited source: 1/1 primary files | returned-plan
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Triage findings | returned-picker
keys: C-c
require-live-snap: 15 CONFIRM SESSION EXIT | exit-choices
keys: y
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 1 planned | recovered-campaign
nav-mode:
keys: a
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN FINDING REVIEW | recovered-plan
expect: Cited source: 1/1 primary files
keys: v Home
require-live-snap: 25 FROZEN SOURCE INPUT | recovered-source
expect: SOURCE_LINE_00
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/review_source_evidence.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME restarted
ask: Does no-color recovery retain the same source text and exact unapproved job, with zero provider calls, approvals and attempts?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 1 planned | returned-campaign
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
